{"id":"1131fa8ff0b18434","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-j-closed-monomorphism.md","title":"Definition — j-闭单射","display":"Definition — j-闭单射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-j-closed-monomorphism","aliases":["14-df-j-closed-monomorphism"],"display":"Definition — j-闭单射","depends_on":["[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]","[[14-df-subobjects]]","[[14-df-elementary-topos]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-j-closed-monomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-j-closed-monomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — j-闭单射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f2ca2aad80752c90\" href=\"?note=f2ca2aad80752c90\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a> 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、分类子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\top)\">\\((\\Omega,\\top)\\)</span> 与有限极限。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a> 的 LT 拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:A\\hookrightarrow X\">\\(m:A\\hookrightarrow X\\)</span>，闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f2ca2aad80752c90\" href=\"?note=f2ca2aad80752c90\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cl}_j([m])=[m].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cl}_j([m])=[m].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 V.1–2。闭子对象就是该闭包的固定点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology","status":"resolved","id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure","status":"resolved","id":"f2ca2aad80752c90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-elementary-topos]] 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 $1$、分类子 $(\\Omega,\\top)$ 与有限极限。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology","status":"resolved","id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$j$ 是 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]] 的 LT 拓扑；$m:A\\hookrightarrow X$，闭包见 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure","status":"resolved","id":"f2ca2aad80752c90","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$j$ 是 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]] 的 LT 拓扑；$m:A\\hookrightarrow X$，闭包见 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"m:A\\hookrightarrow X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cl}_j([m])=[m].","display":true}],"bytes":837,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism|Definition — j-闭单射]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism|Definition — j-闭单射]]"},{"id":"59d5dc773385bba2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)$ 分别采用 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]、[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]] 的精确签名。"},{"id":"8e769e1f3e412be1","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$j$ 为其选定分类子上的 LT 拓扑，$m:A\\hookrightarrow X$ 为 $\\mathcal E$ 中的单态射；j-闭包及稠密、闭见 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]、[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]、[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]]。"},{"id":"592d7bea8469dc16","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d179a7fa180f99f9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,j$ 为初等拓扑斯与 LT 拓扑，$X$ 为对象。积和配对见 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]。$\\Delta_X,\\delta_X$ 及 $G(f)$ 在下式定义；$\\chi_U$ 是子对象 $U$ 的特征箭头。$f:B\\to X$ 的图像作为 $B\\times X$ 的子对象解释；$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}$ 与 $\\mathrm{IsJClosed}$ 分别使用 [[14-df-j-separated-objects]]、[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]]。"}],"outgoing":["4b8f9443a0ee72c6","f2ca2aad80752c90","d3923e299ec2ec5a","4e6c05c92e3b9bf9"]}